---
import PlatformLayout from '../../layouts/PlatformLayout.astro';
import { covers, sections, demoHref } from '../../demo/content';
import { LayoutGrid, Image, Link, ArrowUpRight, Plus, ArrowLeft, Check, Save } from '@lucide/astro';
---
<PlatformLayout studio title="内容工作台">
  <div class="s-shell">
    <aside class="s-sidebar"><a class="s-brand" href={demoHref()}>CookDance</a><small>CONTENT STUDIO</small><nav class="s-nav" aria-label="工作台导航"><button data-studio-tab="library" aria-selected="true"><Image size={17} />内容库</button><button data-studio-tab="home" aria-selected="false"><LayoutGrid size={17} />首页编排</button><button data-studio-tab="channels" aria-selected="false"><Link size={17} />购买渠道</button></nav><div class="s-sidebar-bottom"><a href={demoHref()} target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看图片首页 <ArrowUpRight size={15} /></a><p>烹饪万物，随处起舞。<br />把内容做好，让图片说话。</p></div></aside>
    <div class="s-main"><div class="s-breadcrumb">CookDance / 内容工作台 / 本地演示</div><div class="s-notice">这是可以操作的后台原型。修改只保存在当前浏览器，不会更新线上网站；换浏览器或清除网站数据后不会保留。正式使用时再接入 GitHub 内容管理与 Cloudflare 自动发布。</div>
      <section data-studio-view="library"><div class="s-heading"><div><h1>内容库</h1><p>一张图片是入口，点进去以后，才是完整的故事。</p></div><button class="s-button" data-new-story><Plus size={16} />新建内容</button></div><div class="s-toolbar"><input id="studio-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索标题、食材或地区" aria-label="搜索内容" /><select id="studio-status" aria-label="按发布状态筛选"><option value="all">全部状态</option><option value="published">已发布</option><option value="draft">草稿</option></select></div><p class="s-card-count" data-studio-count></p><div class="s-list" data-studio-list></div></section>
      <section data-studio-view="editor" hidden><div class="s-heading"><div><button class="p-plain-link" data-back-library><ArrowLeft size={14} />返回内容库</button><h1 data-editor-heading>编辑内容</h1></div><a class="s-button s-button-light" data-editor-preview target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看前台 <ArrowUpRight size={14} /></a></div>
        <form id="story-form"><input type="hidden" name="id" /><div class="s-editor"><div class="s-editor-main"><label class="s-field">标题<input name="title" required maxlength="150" placeholder="A simple pleasure, worth sharing." /><small>首页不显示标题。标题用于详情页、搜索和辅助阅读。</small></label><label class="s-field">一句话介绍<textarea name="description" rows="3" maxlength="400" required></textarea></label><label class="s-field">正文<textarea name="body" rows="17" maxlength="40000" required></textarea><small>使用 ## 小标题，段落之间空一行。此原型将输入作为文字显示，不执行 HTML。</small></label></div><aside class="s-editor-side"><img src={covers[0].src} alt="当前内容的封面预览" data-cover-preview /><label class="s-field">封面图片<select name="image">{covers.map(cover => <option value={cover.src}>{cover.name}</option>)}</select><small>先使用演示素材库。带 AI concept 的图片是生成素材。</small></label><label class="s-field">内容类型<select name="section">{sections.map(section => <option value={section}>{section}</option>)}</select></label><label class="s-field">分类<input name="category" required maxlength="80" /></label><label class="s-field">地区 / 风味线索<input name="region" maxlength="80" placeholder="例如 Mediterranean-inspired" /><small>用于搜索和详情说明，不挤占首页。</small></label></aside></div><div class="s-editor-actions"><button type="submit" class="s-button s-button-light" name="action" value="draft"><Save size={14} />保存草稿</button><button type="submit" class="s-button" name="action" value="published"><Check size={15} />发布到本地演示</button></div><p class="s-message" role="status" data-editor-message></p></form>
      </section>
      <section class="s-panel" data-studio-view="home" hidden><div class="s-heading"><div><h1>首页编排</h1><p>首页保持纯图片。通过首图和内容顺序，决定每次进入时的第一印象。</p></div></div><div class="s-settings"><h2>让图片带路。</h2><p>桌面根据窗口宽度排列 3—5 列，手机两列。图片保留竖幅、方形和横幅的节奏，标题和文字留在详情页。</p><form id="home-form"><label class="s-field">首页第一张图片<select name="featured" data-featured-select></select></label><div class="s-home-preview" data-home-preview></div><button type="submit" class="s-button">保存首页编排</button><p class="s-message" role="status" data-home-message></p></form></div><div class="s-settings" style="margin-top:22px"><h2>内容数据可以带走。</h2><p>导出演示中的内容、图片关联和购买链接。正式后台可以沿用这些字段，再接入内容审核和自动发布。</p><button class="s-button s-button-light" data-export>导出内容 JSON</button><button class="p-plain-link s-danger" data-reset style="margin-left:20px">恢复演示初始内容</button><p class="s-message" role="status" data-export-message></p></div></section>
      <section class="s-panel" data-studio-view="channels" hidden><div class="s-heading"><div><h1>购买渠道</h1><p>让购买链接出现在相关内容里，给首页留出看图的空间。</p></div></div><div class="s-settings"><h2>工具内容的延伸。</h2><p>配置后，这些链接会出现在 Kitchen 类型内容的详情页。可以连接品牌官网、零售商或未来的 Shopify 商店。演示不包含支付，也没有预置商业合作。</p><div data-channel-list></div><form id="channel-form" style="margin-top:25px"><div class="s-form-grid"><label class="s-field">渠道名称<input name="label" maxlength="80" required placeholder="品牌官网 / 店铺名称" /></label><label class="s-field">HTTPS 链接<input name="url" type="url" required placeholder="https://" /></label></div><label class="s-check"><input type="checkbox" name="affiliate" />这是联盟 / 佣金链接（详情页会显示披露说明）</label><button type="submit" class="s-button"><Plus size={15} />添加渠道</button><p class="s-message" role="status" data-channel-message></p></form></div></section>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>import '../../demo/studio';</script>
</PlatformLayout>
